  "html": "<p><br/>\nOffensive <a href=\"/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">skills</a> are intended to damage a target.  A target's resistance to the particular offensive skill is determined by either it's defense rating, if the skill requires a weapon; or it's elemental resistance if the skill is an area-of-effect or a directed spell.\n</p><p><br/>\n<small>This list is sortable. Click the button next to the heading you wish to sort by. A 2 column sort is also possible, by first sorting one column then the second. </small>\n</p>\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"sortable\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<tr>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Icon\n</th><th>Skill Name\n</th><th>Class\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\"># of Ranks\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\">Recharge Time\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\">Effect\n</th><th class=\"unsortable\">Range\n</th><th>Weapon Req'd\n</th><th>Element\n</th><th>Level First Available\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Butcher.png\" title=\"Image:Butcher.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Butcher.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Butcher.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Butcher\" title=\"Butcher\">Butcher</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Damage and Increases Attack Rating, chance to knock down\n</td><td>Target\n</td><td>Melee\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Cleave.png\" title=\"Image:Cleave.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Cleave.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Cleave.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Cleave\" title=\"Cleave\">Cleave</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Damage and Increased Attack Rating\n</td><td>Adjacent\n</td><td>Melee\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>9\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fear-of-gosh.png\" title=\"Image:Fear-of-gosh.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Fear-of-gosh.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Fear-of-gosh.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Fear_of_Gosh\" title=\"Fear of Gosh\">Fear of Gosh</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>5\n</td><td>5\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Causes enemy to flee, does Divine damage\n</td><td>Target + Nearby\n</td><td>Melee\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td>14\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Holy-roller.png\" title=\"Image:Holy-roller.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Holy-roller.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Holy-roller.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Holy_Roller\" title=\"Holy Roller\">Holy Roller</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>17\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Charge enemy, deal Divine damage and slow, chance to knock over\n</td><td>Target\n</td><td>Melee\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td>20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Righteous-stomp.jpg\" title=\"Image:Righteous-stomp.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Righteous-stomp.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Righteous-stomp.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Righteous_Stomp\" title=\"Righteous Stomp\">Righteous Stomp</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>15\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Knock back enemies and deal Divine Damage\n</td><td>PbAoE\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td>8\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Soul-rend.png\" title=\"Image:Soul-rend.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Soul-rend.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Soul-rend.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Soul_Rend\" title=\"Soul Rend\">Soul Rend</a>\n</td><td>Fighter\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Weapon infused with Divine Damage over time\n</td><td>Target\n</td><td>Melee\n</td><td>Divine\n</td><td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Gaseous-blast.png\" title=\"Image:Gaseous-blast.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Gaseous-blast.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Gaseous-blast.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Gaseous_Blast\" title=\"Gaseous Blast\">Gaseous Blast</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>10\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Causes poison damage over time\n</td><td>PbAoE\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Monster-bait.png\" title=\"Image:Monster-bait.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Monster-bait.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Monster-bait.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Monster_Bait\" title=\"Monster Bait\">Monster Bait</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>17\n</td><td>45\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Summon bait to draw enemy attack\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>19\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Noxious-shot.png\" title=\"Image:Noxious-shot.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Noxious-shot.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Noxious-shot.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Noxious_Shot\" title=\"Noxious Shot\">Noxious Shot</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Deals Poison damage\n</td><td>Range + AoE\n</td><td>Ranged\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td>15\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Poison-shot.png\" title=\"Image:Poison-shot.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Poison-shot.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Poison-shot.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Shot\" title=\"Poison Shot\">Poison Shot</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Deals Poison damage over time\n</td><td>Range\n</td><td>Ranged\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Putrid-penetration.png\" title=\"Image:Putrid-penetration.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Putrid-penetration.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"42\" src=\"/images/recovered/Putrid-penetration.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Putrid_Penetration\" title=\"Putrid Penetration\">Putrid Penetration</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>16\n</td><td>10\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Deals Poison damage, chance to knock down\n</td><td>Range + Penetrate\n</td><td>Ranged\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td>25\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Shiver_Shot.png\" title=\"Image:Shiver_Shot.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Shiver_Shot.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Shiver_Shot.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Shiver_Shot\" title=\"Shiver Shot\">Shiver Shot</a>\n</td><td>Ranger\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Ice Damage, Reduces Movement and Attack Speed of affected.\n</td><td>Target + AoE\n</td><td>Ranged\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td>16\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Build_Snowman.png\" title=\"Image:Skill-_Build_Snowman.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Skill-_Build_Snowman.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Skill-_Build_Snowman.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Build_Snowman\" title=\"Build Snowman\">Build Snowman</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>45\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Summons a Snowman to Fight with you.\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>30\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Crispy_Critters.png\" title=\"Image:Crispy_Critters.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Crispy_Critters.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Crispy_Critters.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Crispy_Critters\" title=\"Crispy Critters\">Crispy Critters</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>17\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Shoot a jet of flame.  Burns an opponent(s)for Fire Damage\n</td><td>AoE (Jet)\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td>20\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Fire-bolt.png\" title=\"Image:Fire-bolt.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Fire-bolt.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Fire-bolt.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Fire_Bolt\" title=\"Fire Bolt\">Fire Bolt</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Deals Fire damage\n</td><td>Range\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td>3\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Ice-bolt.png\" title=\"Image:Ice-bolt.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Ice-bolt.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Ice-bolt.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Bolt\" title=\"Ice Bolt\">Ice Bolt</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Deals Ice damage, slow movement + attack speed\n</td><td>Range\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td>5\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Ice-shards.jpg\" title=\"Image:Ice-shards.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Ice-shards.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Ice-shards.jpg\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ice_Shards\" title=\"Ice Shards\">Ice Shards</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Deals Ice damage\n</td><td>Range\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Ice\n</td><td>16\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Ring-of-fire.png\" title=\"Image:Ring-of-fire.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Ring-of-fire.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/Ring-of-fire.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Ring_of_Fire\" title=\"Ring of Fire\">Ring of Fire</a>\n</td><td>Mage\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>8\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Fires multiple fire bolts in 360 degree radius\n</td><td>Range\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>Fire\n</td><td>12\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/im